# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local Cloudflare previews (`npm run cf:preview`).
# `.dev.vars` is gitignored; this example is not. Never put real secrets here.
#
# On the real host these live in the platform's environment settings:
#   Cloudflare -> Workers -> ccdgroup -> Settings -> Variables
#   Vercel     -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables

# CMS sign-in. From the GitHub OAuth App (docs/CMS-SETUP.md).
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=local_test_client_id
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=local_test_client_secret

# Contact-form storage. WITHOUT THESE, form submissions are not saved and
# visitors are told to email instead. See ccd-website/supabase/schema.sql.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# Where contact / volunteer / estimate form submissions go.
#
# Set RESEND_API_KEY and the forms start emailing CCD. Without it (and without
# Supabase below) the forms tell visitors to email directly instead — they are
# never told a submission worked when nobody received it.
#
# Get a key free at https://resend.com — sign up AS info@ccdgroup.org, because
# until ccdgroup.org is verified there, Resend will only deliver to the address
# the account was opened with.
# RESEND_API_KEY=
#
# Optional. FORM_EMAIL_TO defaults to the contact address in the CMS
# (Settings -> Contact details), so staff can redirect enquiries without a
# developer. FORM_EMAIL_FROM needs a Resend-verified domain to change.
# FORM_EMAIL_TO=
# FORM_EMAIL_FROM=
